Bundled default donors are compact source exports of Sillyw0rld's own vehicles,
licensed under this project's licence. They omit meshes and audio. Other car
mods, BeamJoy-Revived, KTS, BeamMP and BeamNG.drive are installed separately.
The optional mods Kagoni's Tyre Simulation, Fluid Spill Mod and Dynamic Damage
Particles are not part of BJR:ME. The server console command `bjrme get` only
downloads them, unmodified, from their official pages when the server owner asks;
they keep their own authors, licences and terms.
Standalone generator packages include a Python runtime. Its applicable licence
notices must accompany redistribution. PyInstaller packages it under its bootloader
exception; build dependencies are listed in packaging/requirements.txt in source.

